KZ3 patch 1032 (diagnostic, opt-in): per-thread wait accounting, new runtime/diag/kz3_wait_acct.{c,h} (see the header there)
and its hooks. Pass 93: the second copy of the two new files (the patch created them twice since the v0.15.0 move, which
GNU patch refuses) is removed.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): context only (upstream v0.18.0 changed lines around the hunks; same change).

